# Vercel Web Analytics Configuration Report

## Summary
Vercel Web Analytics is **already properly installed and configured** in this Next.js portfolio project.

## Current Configuration

### Package Installation
- **Package**: `@vercel/analytics` version 2.0.1
- **Location**: Listed in `package.json` dependencies
- **Status**: ✅ Already installed

### Code Integration
- **File**: `app/layout.tsx` (Root Layout)
- **Import**: `import { Analytics } from '@vercel/analytics/next';`
- **Component**: `<Analytics />` properly placed inside the `<body>` tag
- **Status**: ✅ Correctly configured

### Configuration Details
```typescript
// app/layout.tsx
import { Analytics } from "@vercel/analytics/next";

export default function RootLayout({
  children,
}: {
  children: React.ReactNode;
}) {
  return (
    <html lang="ko" suppressHydrationWarning>
      <body className={inter.className}>
        <ThemeProvider
          attribute="class"
          defaultTheme="light"
          enableSystem
          disableTransitionOnChange
        >
          {children}
          <SpeedInsights />
          <Analytics />  {/* ✅ Properly configured */}
        </ThemeProvider>
      </body>
    </html>
  );
}
```

