## Next Steps

To complete the setup and start collecting analytics:
1. Ensure the project is deployed to Vercel
2. Enable Web Analytics in the Vercel Dashboard (Settings → Analytics → Enable)
3. Visit your deployed site to verify analytics are being collected
4. Check Network tab for requests to `/<unique-path>/view`

